Subject: Re: Issue when using SparkR with Spark 1.1.0
Message-ID: <664V1641SBo.XqYSwNavjKwJ@sparkr-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <664V1641SBo.CAfThkDl-WkJ@sparkr-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <664V1641SBo.CAfThkDl-WkJ@sparkr-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/sparkr-dev/c/664V1641SBo/m/XqYSwNavjKwJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This is caused by a bug in Makefile that modifications to build.sbt will not trigger rebuilding.

This can be fixed by change the following line in pkg/src/Makefile:
  $(SBT_TARGET_NAME): $(SCALA_FILES) $(RESOURCE_FILES)

to

  $(SBT_TARGET_NAME): build.sbt $(SCALA_FILES) $(RESOURCE_FILES)

在 2014年9月22日星期一UTC+8上午9时46分33秒，hipho...@gmail.com写道：

